  "limitations": [
    "12 attempted trials; 8 completed, 4 nonzero host exits. Two explicitly reported usage limits; two causes were not captured. No failed trial is dropped or counted as correct.",
    "Only one off/empty trial completed; this run does not meet three completed trials per cell. Further model runs were stopped at the account usage limit.",
    "First effective action is the first observed tool-action event proxy, not measured time to first business code edit.",
    "Off/history has no installed Skill or accessible seeded store; it is the same no-access baseline as off/empty. Only on/history seeds three synthetic related rules.",
    "Positive code behavior passed all six independent cases in every completed trial; generated tests also passed. Does not establish exhaustive semantics or every-turn memory compliance.",
    "One on/empty host reported a failed maintenance review due to scope mismatch. Final guidance now exposes record_scope/task_id and has program coverage; no fresh model rerun of that fix.",
    "Token counts are host-reported best effort, cached input is part of input. Failed invocations have unavailable token counts.",
    "No latency-free claim: completed memory-on tasks are substantially slower in this small sample. Historical microbenchmarks do not replace whole-workflow timing."
